214 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Warehouse operators still rely heavily on manual barcode scanning or teleoperated tools to track inventory. These methods are slow, inconsistent, and difficult to scale as warehouses grow as witnessed currently with the rise of instant delivery. While fully autonomous commercial solutions exist, they depend on expensive RGB-D sensors, high-end GPUs, and complex lift systems, makes them economically unviable for widespread deployment in such warehouses.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
