220 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Perception is driven by SAM3-powered segmentation, enabling highly accurate detection of racks, QR codes, and objects within each shelf. During the brief initialization window, keyframes are processed to extract precise rack geometry. At runtime, the system operates entirely onboard, using dual-baseline triangulation from horizontally shifted monocular frames for depth estimation. QR recognition is handled by XZing, delivering fast, reliable decoding that remains robust even on low-power compute.)
/E (Perception is driven by SAM3-powered segmentation, enabling highly accurate detection of racks, QR codes, and objects within each shelf. During the brief initialization window, keyframes are processed to extract precise rack geometry. At runtime, the system operates entirely onboard, using dual-baseline triangulation from horizontally shifted monocular frames for depth estimation. QR recognition is handled by XZing, delivering fast, reliable decoding that remains robust even on low-power compute.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
