/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A web-based operations dashboard provides real-time mission telemetry and a complete inventory pipeline, including live inventory management, duplicate resolution, and automated detection of missing or inconsistent shelf entries.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [11]
>>
