/T (YD-LiDAR X4 provides 360-degree obstacle detection at a maximum of 3 kHz scan rate. The sensor connects directly to the Pi 4 via USB, utilizing the YD-LiDAR ROS2 driver for publishing scan messages. The mounting height of 80mm above ground provides optimal coverage of warehouse floor obstacles while minimizing ground reflections.)
/E (YD-LiDAR X4 provides 360-degree obstacle detection at a maximum of 3 kHz scan rate. The sensor connects directly to the Pi 4 via USB, utilizing the YD-LiDAR ROS2 driver for publishing scan messages. The mounting height of 80mm above ground provides optimal coverage of warehouse floor obstacles while minimizing ground reflections.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [39]
>>
endobj
