682 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The MPU6050 IMU, fused with wheel odometry, improves dead-reckoning accuracy between LiDAR updates. The 6-axis sensor \(3-axis gyro, 3-axis accelerometer\) connects to the Pico 2 via I2C, providing 100Hz orientation updates. This is particularly critical during high-speed turns where wheel slip can corrupt pure odometry estimates.)
/E (The MPU6050 IMU, fused with wheel odometry, improves dead-reckoning accuracy between LiDAR updates. The 6-axis sensor \(3-axis gyro, 3-axis accelerometer\) connects to the Pico 2 via I2C, providing 100Hz orientation updates. This is particularly critical during high-speed turns where wheel slip can corrupt pure odometry estimates.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [40]
>>
