/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Pre-encoded DC 12 V Johnson quad-encoder motors are used each providing 4680 counts per revolution after quadrature decoding. With 100 mm wheel diameter \(wheel circumference of approximately 314 mm\) which provides in about 14.9 counts per millimeter of linear travel, it enables precise odometry with sub-millimeter positional accuracy under ideal traction conditions.)
/E (Pre-encoded DC 12 V Johnson quad-encoder motors are used each providing 4680 counts per revolution after quadrature decoding. With 100 mm wheel diameter \(wheel circumference of approximately 314 mm\) which provides in about 14.9 counts per millimeter of linear travel, it enables precise odometry with sub-millimeter positional accuracy under ideal traction conditions.)
/Alt ()
