707 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The system is powered by a 6S LiPo battery \(22.2 V, 10 000 mAh\), chosen for its high energy density and ability to supply stable power to the motors, sensors, and onboard compute. The higher bus voltage reduces current draw, improving efficiency and lowering heat generation in the power electronics. With its 10,000 mAh capacity, the battery supports multi-hour operation on a single charge, meeting the runtime requirements of extended warehouse scanning tasks without adding excessive weight or bulk.)
/E (The system is powered by a 6S LiPo battery \(22.2 V, 10 000 mAh\), chosen for its high energy density and ability to supply stable power to the motors, sensors, and onboard compute. The higher bus voltage reduces current draw, improving efficiency and lowering heat generation in the power electronics. With its 10,000 mAh capacity, the battery supports multi-hour operation on a single charge, meeting the runtime requirements of extended warehouse scanning tasks without adding excessive weight or bulk.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
