<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The BTS7960 motor driver was selected for its high 43 A peak current rating and reliable dual-channel H-bridge design. However, its logic interface expects 5 V TTL signals, while the Raspberry Pi Pico 2 operates strictly at 3.3 V GPIO, creating a voltage-level mismatch.)
/E (The BTS7960 motor driver was selected for its high 43 A peak current rating and reliable dual-channel H-bridge design. However, its logic interface expects 5 V TTL signals, while the Raspberry Pi Pico 2 operates strictly at 3.3 V GPIO, creating a voltage-level mismatch.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
