endobj
773 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The problem statement requires a 5-meter obstacle detection range. Warehouse aisles are typically 3 to 4 meters wide. The YD-LiDAR's 8-meter range provides more than adequate coverage. The slightly lower scan rate \(we run at 10Hz\) is compensated for by our DR-CLF-CBF controller, which is designed to handle sensor latency and uncertainty.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
