890 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Together, these operational subproblems form the backbone of the autonomy pipeline: low-level motion abstraction via Linorobot, continuous localization through SLAM and an EKF, safe global and local planning through Nav2 and custom costmap layers, and mission-level decision logic implemented in a finite state machine. Around these, the QR-decoding subsystem and data-logging pipeline provide the informational output expected from a warehouse-ready system.)
/E (Together, these operational subproblems form the backbone of the autonomy pipeline: low-level motion abstraction via Linorobot, continuous localization through SLAM and an EKF, safe global and local planning through Nav2 and custom costmap layers, and mission-level decision logic implemented in a finite state machine. Around these, the QR-decoding subsystem and data-logging pipeline provide the informational output expected from a warehouse-ready system.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
