/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (YOLO + Pyzbar \(Learning-Based\): This two-stage pipeline first uses YOLOv8 \(a CNN-based object detector\) to identify bounding boxes around QR codes, then passes cropped regions to Pyzbar for decoding. While robust to difficult visual conditions, this approach achieves only 1-2fps on the Raspberry Pi 4, making it unsuitable for real-time scanning during vertical motion.)
/E (YOLO + Pyzbar \(Learning-Based\): This two-stage pipeline first uses YOLOv8 \(a CNN-based object detector\) to identify bounding boxes around QR codes, then passes cropped regions to Pyzbar for decoding. While robust to difficult visual conditions, this approach achieves only 1-2fps on the Raspberry Pi 4, making it unsuitable for real-time scanning during vertical motion.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [10]
