/T (Sim-to-real transfer is helped by keeping the two worlds almost identical: same URDF, same sensor intrinsics, same controller gains, same TF tree, and the same launch files. In practice, paths taken in simulation closely resemble those taken by the physical rover in our test arena, and SLAM and QR-detection performance are comparable.)
