/E (In large warehouses with dynamic SKUs, pallets, and box-based storage, understanding how much space is currently filled versus available is critical for inventory efficiency, capacity forecasting, and storage optimization. Traditional shelf scanning systems require expensive 3D sensors, full object visibility, or manual auditing.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [7]
>>
